# setuptools' legacy sdist default picks up `test*.py` but not
# `tests/__init__.py`, which makes the shipped tests silently
# undiscoverable: `python -m unittest` inside an unpacked sdist reports
# "Ran 0 tests ... OK". Ship the whole package so the suite a downstream
# packager runs is the suite this project actually has.
recursive-include tests *.py

include LICENSE
include README.md
include ROADMAP.md
include GATES.md
include CONTRIBUTING.md
